+// coop-pondfish (the developer 11-19: the fish in the pond synced): in a co-op game each town's pond is one shared pond of 6 or 7 fish, always
+// in the water, every fisher fishing it (port/src/coop/coop_eventslots.cpp, CoopPond*).
+bool CoopPondExit();                // FishingExit: the pond's fish stay (true: not cleared)
